<title>CHILE: Chile's Concha y Toro 1996 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Concha y Toro 1996 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winery Vina Concha y Toro SA reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>				1996		1995</p>
<p>Net profit		  6.51    profit  3.33</p>
<p>Operating profit	  7.85    profit  4.16</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	0.40    loss    0.51</p>
<p>Total sales		 48.48	     39.12</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
</text>
